[00:00.00]Amazing Grace - G.E.M. 邓紫棋
[00:00.36]词/曲 Written by：John Newton
[00:00.73]编曲 Arranged by：G.E.M.邓紫棋
[00:01.23]制作人 Producer：G.E.M.邓紫棋
[00:01.74]和音 Bvox：G.E.M.邓紫棋
[00:02.19]和音处理 Vocoder：宫阁
[00:02.56]混音 Mixed by：刘思宇
[00:02.93]母带 Mastered by：刘思宇
[00:03.29]Amazing grace how sweet the sound
[00:19.26]奇妙恩典 何等甘甜
[00:19.26]That saved a wretch like me
[00:33.25]拯救了卑劣的人如我
[00:33.25]I once was lost but now I'm found
[00:48.93]我曾迷失 可幸已被寻回
[00:48.93]Was blind but now I see
[01:02.18]我曾瞎眼 幸已重见光明
[01:02.18]T'was grace that taught my heart to fear
[01:15.98]正是恩典 教我心生敬畏
[01:15.98]And grace my fears relieved
[01:27.99]也是恩典 救我脱离恐惧
[01:27.99]How precious did that grace appear
[01:44.55]何其宝贵 那恩典向我显明
[01:44.55]The hour I first believed
[02:23.49]从我一开始相信
[02:23.49]Through many dangers toils and snares
[02:33.80]沿路多少罗网与陷阱
[02:33.80]We have already come
[02:44.02]我们一一度过
[02:44.02]T'was grace that brought us safe thus far
[02:54.39]是恩典让我们至此安然
[02:54.39]And grace will lead us home
[03:04.55]恩典也将带我们回家
[03:04.55]When we've been there ten thousand years
[03:14.95]而当我们终于经历万年
[03:14.95]Bright shining as the sun
[03:25.19]终如明日一般耀眼
[03:25.19]We've no less days to sing god's praise
[03:43.22]对祂的颂歌 我们仍旧会高唱
[03:43.22]Than when we first begun
[04:13.96]由始至终不灭
[04:13.96]I once was lost but now I'm found
[04:27.37]我曾迷失 可幸已被寻回
[04:27.37]Was blind but now I see